      en: ["Granted city rights in 1639 by Governor General Per Brahe.", "Häme Castle was originally built as a Swedish defensive fortification.", "Jean Sibelius was born in Hämeenlinna on December 8, 1865.", "Finland's first railway line (Helsinki to Hämeenlinna) opened in 1862.", "The Aulanko observation tower provides views of one of Finland's national landscapes.", "Home to the main campus of the Häme University of Applied Sciences (HAMK)."],
