      en: ["Kurikka was officially chartered as a city in 1977.", "The city's land area nearly doubled following its merger with Jalasjärvi in 2016.", "The Kyrönjoki River, flowing through Kurikka, is prone to significant seasonal flooding.", "Jurva, a part of Kurikka, is home to the Museum of Woodcarving.", "Major industrial employers include companies specializing in forest machinery.", "The city is a traditional center for the 'Pelipaitat' textile industry."],
      es: ["Fundada: 1868", "Habitantes: ~20.000", "Río Kyrönjoki", "Centro de la industria del mueble", "Juha Mieto (leyenda del esquí)", "Colina Pitämönvuori"],
