      en: ["Laitila was established as a municipality in 1868 and became a city in 1986.", "St. Michael’s Church is a significant example of medieval stone architecture from 1490.", "Laitila accounts for a massive portion of the national egg production in Finland.", "The village of Untamala serves as an open-air museum for regional history.", "The local beverage factory is the largest producer of craft sodas in Finland.", "Archaeological excavations in Laitila have revealed unique Roman-period artifacts."],
