      en: ["Nuutajärvi Glassworks in Urjala was founded in 1793", "Acclaimed author Väinö Linna was born and raised in Urjala", "The Urjala Church is a neoclassical structure dating from 1806", "Lake Rutajärvi is a significant local natural and leisure resource", "Urjala is famous for its collection of historic manor houses", "The town is a key center for the Finnish glass and design industry"],
